Z||000000||wkayl||10-04-2001||10:41 AM||||Luxembourg.  My brother is building our family tree and has found out we have ties there.  If you find a detailed map of Luxembourg there is the city of Kayl in the southern part.  Story goes that my ancestors founded that city.  A friend of my brother visited there this past summer and found a grave yard that has some sort of shrine with lots of graves with Kayl on them.  He took lots of video I hope to get a copy of.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_2.jpg">    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/usa1017[1].gif">   <BR>Dnyee's 88 Formula, Casey's 86GT, Wayne's 86GT.  <BR>We consider my wife as being "Fiero Challenged"||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||10-04-2001||11:17 AM||||Yes. I've been to Luxemburg quite a few times and it's a very nice (and very small) country! Especially around Christmas Luxemburg city is very, very nice.||||reg||1
